   338	### Whether a round continues
   339	
   340	- A round continues only when the model stopped for `tool_use`, named at least one tool, and a `ToolRegistry` is configured ([validated by: continues when the model requested a tool and a registry can run it](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L11)).
   341	- With no registry configured the loop stops, whatever the model asked for, because nothing could execute the call ([validated by: stops when no registry is configured, whatever the model asked for](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L15)).
   342	- A `tool_use` stop naming no tool stops the loop, rather than re-querying with nothing to add ([validated by: stops when the model named no tool](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L19)).
   343	- Any other stop reason ends the loop even when tool calls are pending ([validated by: stops when the model finished for a reason other than tool use](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L23)).
